---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Our website only collects information necessary to maintain your session through the use of cookies.</p>
    
    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>The session information is used solely to keep you logged in during your visit to our website.</p>
    
    <h2>Data Storage</h2>
    <p>Session data is stored locally on your device in the form of cookies and is not collected or stored on our servers.</p>
    
    <h2>Third-Party Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We do not share your information with any third parties.</p>
    
    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal information we might hold about you.</p>
    
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new policy on this page.</p>
    <p>Last updated: <time datetime="2025-05-01">May 1, 2025</time></p>    
</Layout>